ia Defeats Glenville State in Exhibition Men’s Basketball Action</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/23/mens-basketball-west-virginia-defeats-glenville-state-in-exhibition-mens-basketball-action</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/23/mens-basketball-west-virginia-defeats-glenville-state-in-exhibition-mens-basketball-action</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia freshman guard Miles Sadler takes part in a preseason practice at the Basketball Practice Facility in Morgantown, West Virginia." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/9/21/Sadler-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />Freshman guard Miles Sadler scored 18 points and handed out six assists in West Virginia's 103-66 exhibition game victory over Glenville State Friday night at the Waco Center in Glenville, West Virginia.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/21/Sadler-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/21/Sadler-Main.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia freshman guard Miles Sadler takes part in a preseason practice at the Basketball Practice Facility in Morgantown, West Virginia.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/9/21/Sadler-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 21:27:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59582</s:story_id></item><item><title>Mountaineers Complete Wrestle-Offs</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/23/wrestling-mountaineers-complete-wrestle-offs</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/10/23/wrestling-mountaineers-complete-wrestle-offs</guid><category>Wrestling</category><description><